  "description": "A perfect bike for when he heads outdoors! The Pueblo Mountain Bike delivers a smooth ride over trails and rough roads thanks to the responsive suspension fork. Easy-to-shift 21-speed Shimano twist shifting delivers reliable performance on both flat and hilly terrain. Dual linear pull brakes deliver great control over wet and dry conditions. This mountain bike provides wider, off-road tires for solid traction. The comfortable, padded saddle features an alloy quick-release seat binder to make it easy to adjust the seat height for the right fit. This bike takes him anywhere, through trails or around town.Manufacturer may substitute components with components of equal or greater performance level.\n\nFeatures:\n\nBoys’ mountain bike designed for trail riding\n\nDurable steel frame with suspension fork is great for a variety of terrain\n\nWeather-resistant and lightweight alloy rims enhance performance\n\nShimano 21-speed twist shifting provides gears for uphill power and downhill speed\n\nFront and rear linear pull brakes provide solid control\n\nQuick-release seat to make easy height adjustments\n\nKickstand included\n\nInstruction Manuals/Warranty Information(PDF)",
